{
  "name": "emo_rap",
  "family": "hip hop",
  "aliases": ["emo", "sad rap", "melodic rap", "soundcloud rap", "guitar trap", "juice wrld", "lil peep"],
  "description": "Emo rap: melodic SoundCloud rap at 130 to 170 BPM in half time, built on a guitar: a clean or acoustic guitar loop picking a sad minor progression, a distorted 808 that slides, a snare or clap on beat three, rolling hats, a soft pad under the hooks, verses and hooks",
